56:eac2fd9c4fd895bcd96385bdc1fbfa8b050eba84e34226ba44b05c28f8bc04a3","file":"preprints/A-hyperbolic-group-with-no-geometric-CAT0-action-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":6,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"88e11b9dff5c80079bee84473e8e0014b0f2e53a56ed1a4e0060eefd50a829f9","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-hyperbolic-group-with-no-geometric-CAT0-action-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:eac2fd9c4fd895bcd96385bdc1fbfa8b050eba84e34226ba44b05c28f8bc04a3","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-hyperbolic-group-with-no-geometric-CAT0-action-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L6"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nThere exist a finite connected two-dimensional aspherical simplicial complex $K$ and a constant $C<\\infty$ with the following properties.\n\\begin{enumerate}[label=\\textup{(\\roman*)}]\n\\item Every combinatorial edge loop of length $\\ell$ in the universal cover of $K$ bounds a disk diagram with at most $C\\ell$ triangular faces.\n\\item The group $\\pi_1K$ admits no geometric action on a proper complete $\\CAT(0)$ space.\n\\end{enumerate}\nIn particular, $\\pi_1K$ is word-hyperbolic, and no finite simplicial complex homotopy equivalent to $K$ admits a locally $\\CAT(0)$ geodesic length metric inducing its given topology. Consequently, no such model admits a compatible locally $\\CAT(-1)$ geodesic length metric."}
